atten-pps3203 - Atten PPS3203T-3S with 3 channels: CH1 CH2 CH3
Channel groups:
    CH1: channel CH1
    CH2: channel CH2
    CH3: channel CH3
Supported configuration options on channel group CH1:
    voltage: 0.000000 (current)
    voltage_target: 0.000000 (current), 32.000000, 0.010000
    current: 0.000000 (current)
    current_limit: 0.000000 (current), 3.000000, 0.001000
    enabled: on, off (current)
